      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah I mean override the tablet mode state *after* gmr_tablet_switch_init invoked.\nIs there any reason it must be done before gmr_tablet_switch_init?\n\nReading board id needs HOOK_PRIO_INIT_ADC (\u003dHOOK_PRIO_DEFAULT), so a correct priority in general will be\n  - ADC available at HOOK_PRIO_DEFAULT\n  - board init at HOOK_PRIO_DEFAULT + 1\n  - gmr_tablet_switch_init at HOOK_PRIO_DEFAULT + 2\n\nI prefer changing board.c, otherwise you have to ensure that things depends on gmr_tablet_switch_init are also ordered correctly.",
